<%# locals: () %>
<%#
  What the one colored chip on a pipeline entry means, and where everything
  else went. One pair, rendered inside each pipeline page's About This Report
  list beside the rank legend, so the six pages sharing the row describe it
  in the same words.
%>
<dt>What is the colored chip on an entry?</dt>
<dd>
  The most serious mark against that person: a raised Personnel flag, else an uber-bonk, else a bonk, else their
  worst rank of 3 or 4; none when their latest ranks are calm. Select a name for every other rank and note, with the
  teams always in the same order:
  <%= Intake::TEAM_ORDER.map { |team| intake_team_label(team) }.join(", ") %>.
</dd>
